1136: /dev/bergamota-sensors, a sensor sample queue (port of Jesvi iOS / HakiOS redwood_sensors, APSL 2.0): drivers
queue struct bergamota_sensor_sample with bergamota_sensors_post(); backboardd's sensor bridge (tools/bergamotanet/sensorbridge.c)
reads them. Boot-arg bergamotasensors bit 0 makes the device (inert by default), bit 1 lets root write() whole samples into
it (test path, tools/bergamotanet/sensorpost.c). Started from bergamota_ufs.c like the other drivers.

